---
import TagPill from './TagPill.astro';

/*
  The draft marker, wherever a draft post surfaces (ADR 0021). It reads the
  entry's flag, never the environment — production filters drafts out before
  anything renders, so the badge can only reach the contexts it belongs in:
  `astro dev` and preview deploys.

  A badge, not a tag: no link, and rose is a hue no tag maps to, so it never
  reads as one more chip in the row.
*/
---

<TagPill tint="rose">draft</TagPill>
